    "id": "SLR_ILRS_Rapid_Orbits_dly_1",
    "stac_version": "1.1.0",
    "description": "Some ILRS Analysis Centers (ACs) provide daily, temporally highly resolved estimates of the 3D positions of the spherical satellites LARES-1, Stella, Starlette, Larets, Westpac, and Ajisai satellite, consistent with the weekly operational ILRS ASC products labelled v90. The satellite positions, expressed in the CRF cover 7-day orbital arcs which are aligned with calendar weeks, running from Sunday to Saturday. Each individual Analysis Center (AC) follows strict standards agreed upon within the ILRS Analysis Standing Committee (ASC) to ensure the highest possible quality and consistency of the resulting products. NOTE: The <yymmdd> in the filenames refers to the last day of the respective week. The x in the filename denotes different versions of the solutions.",
